* NOTE:
* values are one-sigma deviations (1/3 of min-max)
.param num_sigmas=1

* ngspice statistical parameters
.param mc_sg13g2_moscap_n_vfbo     ='gauss(sg13g2_moscap_n_vfbo_norm ,    0.0050, num_sigmas)'
